                <text type="forecast">Sunny. Light winds becoming east to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h in the morning then tending south to southeasterly in the late afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to around 8 with daytime temperatures reaching the low 20s.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-08-30T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-08-31T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-29T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-30T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">The chance of morning fog. Sunny afternoon. Light winds becoming southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h during the day then becoming light during the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 7 and 10 with daytime temperatures reaching between 18 and 21.</text>
